As expected for the small rung, all three vendors solved `easy`; the harness has escalated to `medium` (\(3\times 7^6\) implicit vertices). This is useful calibration rather than a gate failure—the shipping preset is currently `hard`.
diff --git a/gen_2405_15663.py b/gen_2405_15663.py
